---
interface Props {
  title: string;
  description?: string;
  image?: string;
}

const { title, description = "생활 절세, 소액 자산관리, 정부지원금 가이드", image = "/og-default.png" } = Astro.props;
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:title" content={title} />
    <meta property="og:description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:image" content={image} />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <!-- 카카오톡 공유 SDK -->
    <script src="https://developers.kakao.com/sdk/js/kakao.min.js" is:inline></script>
  </head>
  <body class="bg-gray-50 text-gray-800 font-sans leading-relaxed">
    <header class="bg-white border-b border-gray-200 sticky top-0 z-50">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 h-16 flex items-center justify-between">
        <a href="/" class="text-xl font-bold text-blue-900">샛터형의 경제 트렌드센터</a>
        <nav class="hidden md:flex space-x-6 text-sm font-medium text-gray-600">
          <a href="/category/tax" class="hover:text-blue-600">생활 절세 및 세금 환급</a>
          <a href="/category/finance" class="hover:text-blue-600">스마트 재테크 & 소액 자산관리</a>
          <a href="/category/policy" class="hover:text-blue-600">정부지원금 및 생활 정책</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <section class="lg:col-span-2">
        <slot />
      </section>

      <!-- 우측 사이드바 (실시간 인기 BEST, 검색, 최신글) -->
      <aside class="space-y-8">
        <!-- 검색창 -->
        <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3 text-base">Search(검색)</h3>
          <form action="/search" method="GET" class="flex gap-2">
            <input 
              type="text" 
              name="q" 
              placeholder="검색어를 입력하세요..." 
              required
              class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500"
            />
            <button type="submit" class="bg-gray-800 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium hover:bg-gray-700">
              검색
            </button>
          </form>
        </div>

        <!-- 실시간 인기 BEST -->
        <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 text-base flex items-center gap-1.5">
            🔥 실시간 인기 BEST
          </h3>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm">
            <li class="border-b pb-2">
              <a href="#" class="font-semibold text-gray-800 hover:text-blue-600 line-clamp-2">
                1. 모르면 매달 손해보는 은행 종수신 폭증 속 이자 극대화 로드맵
              </a>
            </li>
            <li class="border-b pb-2">
              <a href="#" class="font-semibold text-gray-800 hover:text-blue-600 line-clamp-2">
                2. 모르면 잃는 신혼부부 세액공제, 13월의 월급을 즉시 확인하세요
              </a>
            </li>
            <li class="border-b pb-2">
              <a href="#" class="font-semibold text-gray-800 hover:text-blue-600 line-clamp-2">
                3. 연말정산 놓쳤다면? 5월 종합소득세 신고·경정청구로 환급받는 법
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </main>

    <footer class="bg-white border-t border-gray-200 py-6 mt-12 text-center text-xs text-gray-500">
      <p>© 2026 샛터형의 경제 트렌드센터. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
